:name: Even Realities G1 (two nRF5340s)
:description: Prepares the emulation for a pair of G1 lenses running prebuilt firmware.
#
# This file compiles the peripheral models and creates the radio medium the
# two lenses share. g1_lens.resc then turns a machine into a lens; it is
# included once for the master lens and once for the slave lens.
#
# Normally run through g1sim.py, which prepares the images from update zips
# or .bin files and writes this sequence. By hand:
#
#   i @g1.resc
#
#   mach create "g1"
#   $app_bin=@/path/app.bin
#   $net_bin=@/path/net.bin
#   $extstore=@/path/g1_extstore_left.bin
#   i @g1_lens.resc
#
#   mach create "g1_slave"
#   $app_bin=@/path/app.bin
#   $net_bin=@/path/net.bin
#   $extstore=@/path/g1_extstore_right.bin
#   $slave=true
#   $deviceaddr0=0x0B5BEB85
#   $deviceaddr1=0xFFFFF265
#   i @g1_lens.resc
#
#   start
#
# g1_lens.resc's header describes these variables.
# The two lenses can be given different firmware.

using sysbus
path add $ORIGIN

# Custom nRF5340 + board peripheral models, all in one "i": Renode then
# compiles them together, in about 1.5 s. One "i" per file is a compiler run
# per file, 11 s for the 30 of them. Compiled together they also see each
# other's types (NRF5340_DPPIC's DPPI hub, which the EGU/Timer/RTC/IPC/RADIO
# models use) whatever their order. Needs Renode 1.16.1 or newer.
i @models/NRF5340_TrapStub.cs @models/NRF5340_UARTE.cs @models/NRF5340_CC3xx_RNG.cs @models/NRF5340_ClockPowerReset.cs @models/NRF5340_DPPIC.cs @models/NRF5340_IPC.cs @models/NRF5340_RADIO.cs @models/BLE_VirtualCentral.cs @models/BLE_VirtualCentralG2.cs @models/NRF5340_AAR.cs @models/NRF5340_CCM.cs @models/NRF5340_TEMP.cs @models/NRF5340_VREQCTRL.cs @models/NRF5340_EGU.cs @models/NRF5340_Timer.cs @models/NRF5340_RTC.cs @models/NRF5340_SPIM.cs @models/JBD_Display.cs @models/Macronix_MX25U.cs @models/NRF5340_NVMC.cs @models/NRF5340_QSPI.cs @models/NRF5340_SAADC.cs @models/NRF5340_PDM.cs @models/GPIO_Pin_Driver.cs @models/NRF5340_TWIM.cs @models/ST_LSM6DSO.cs @models/TI_OPT3001.cs @models/Nordic_NPM1300.cs @models/ST_ST25DV.cs @models/G1_TouchController.cs

# The radio medium the lenses of a pair (and nothing else) share.
emulation CreateBLEMedium "wireless"
